Data licence

The images and masks in the data/ folder are a modified version of the
Visual Anomaly (VisA) dataset by Yang Zou, Jongheon Jeong, Latha Pemula,
Dongqing Zhang, and Onkar Dabeer, released by Amazon under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Original source: https://github.com/amazon-science/spot-diff

Changes made for CS 5330 (Northeastern University):
  - Selected six subsets: cashew, macaroni1, chewinggum, fryum, pipe_fryum, macaroni2
  - Resampled each subset into new reference, dev, and test splits
  - Resized images and masks so the longer side is 512 px
  - Converted masks to binary (0 = normal, 255 = anomaly)
  - Re-encoded images as JPEG and removed all metadata

The modified data in data/ is also released under CC BY 4.0.

